1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,389
Seven failures. Seven smiles.

2
00:00:02,389 --> 00:00:09,559
Someone is failing the Chunin Exam on purpose, and a twelve year old filing clerk just noticed.

3
00:00:09,777 --> 00:00:12,984
Naruto Uzumaki reads whatever his clones learn.

4
00:00:12,984 --> 00:00:19,331
He's emptied the archive and built a bridge. He does not get stronger. He gets to read first.

5
00:00:19,573 --> 00:00:22,302
[CLONE] Boss. This guy's failed the exam seven times.

6
00:00:22,438 --> 00:00:26,037
[NARUTO] Seven? Nobody's that bad at anything. Pull his file.

7
00:00:26,149 --> 00:00:27,406
Kabuto Yakushi.

8
00:00:27,406 --> 00:00:34,863
Seven failed exams, one friendly smile, and in canon, every single failure is on purpose.

9
00:00:37,783 --> 00:00:40,048
Kabuto's file is thin and spotless.

10
00:00:40,048 --> 00:00:46,712
A clean record, a kind face, and a photograph where he smiles like he knows where the camera is hidden.

11
00:00:46,971 --> 00:00:51,415
[CLONE] Boss, he's polite in every single report. Nobody's polite in every single report.

12
00:00:51,561 --> 00:00:56,025
[NARUTO] Everybody gets one complaint. Iruka's got eleven. I've got a whole shelf.

13
00:00:56,168 --> 00:00:57,792
[CLONE] And Kabuto has none.

14
00:00:57,934 --> 00:00:59,098
[NARUTO] Then let's go say hello.

15
00:00:59,251 --> 00:01:00,372
Registration day.

16
00:01:00,372 --> 00:01:09,080
The exam hall smells of nerves and floor wax, and near the door a young man in round glasses is handing out cards like a shopkeeper.

17
00:01:09,309 --> 00:01:12,291
[KABUTO] First time? Don't be shy. I'm Kabuto Yakushi.

18
00:01:12,291 --> 00:01:17,063
[KABUTO] I've failed this exam seven times, so I know where all the mistakes are.

19
00:01:17,195 --> 00:01:22,298
[KABUTO] These are info cards. Every genin in the village, every mission, every stat.

20
00:01:22,298 --> 00:01:24,044
[KABUTO] Take a look. They're free.

21
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,274
[SASUKE] Show me mine.

22
00:01:25,425 --> 00:01:30,975
[KABUTO] Sasuke Uchiha. Sharingan, clean record, no wounds worth a note.

23
00:01:30,975 --> 00:01:34,499
[KABUTO] And Naruto Uzumaki. Oh, this one's easy.

24
00:01:34,648 --> 00:01:39,755
Kabuto turns the card around for half a second. Naruto reads it twice.

25
00:01:39,755 --> 00:01:46,102
Shadow clones, never more than ten at a time. Has slept nineteen hours straight. Twice.

26
00:01:46,340 --> 00:01:51,374
That isn't in any file. Naruto would know. He filed every file.

27
00:01:51,830 --> 00:01:54,739
[KABUTO] Good luck in there, Naruto. Try not to collapse.

28
00:01:54,884 --> 00:01:58,183
[SASUKE] Hn. He's too friendly. I don't like it.

29
00:01:58,311 --> 00:02:01,350
[NARUTO] Wow. We agree. Somebody mark the date.

30
00:02:01,495 --> 00:02:03,099
[CLONE] Boss. Maybe he guessed.

31
00:02:03,214 --> 00:02:04,988
[NARUTO] Nobody guesses nineteen hours.

32
00:02:05,133 --> 00:02:06,395
He doesn't go home.

33
00:02:06,395 --> 00:02:12,042
He goes straight up the Hokage tower, past two startled guards, and he doesn't knock.

34
00:02:12,297 --> 00:02:15,625
[NARUTO] Old man. There's a genin in the exam with cards that know things.

35
00:02:15,625 --> 00:02:19,261
[NARUTO] I've read your archive, every shelf. He knows things that aren't in it.

36
00:02:19,402 --> 00:02:26,246
[HIRUZEN] Kabuto Yakushi. Seven attempts and not one complaint. Hm.

37
00:02:26,402 --> 00:02:29,956
[NARUTO] Somebody who's very good at not being in the paperwork. That's who.

38
00:02:30,089 --> 00:02:36,273
[HIRUZEN] Then we don't throw him out. A spy we can see is a spy we can read.

39
00:02:36,402 --> 00:02:40,240
The old man's left hand forms a cross seal on the desk.

40
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:44,496
He doesn't notice. Naruto does. He files that away for later.

41
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:50,597
The written exam. Two hundred genin, a wall clock, and chunin along every wall.

42
00:02:50,597 --> 00:02:56,074
At the front stands Ibiki Morino, who has never once been called friendly.

43
00:02:56,294 --> 00:03:01,683
[IBIKI] Ten questions. The tenth comes last. Get caught cheating and you lose points.

44
00:03:01,683 --> 00:03:04,483
[IBIKI] Get caught enough and you lose the exam.

45
00:03:04,604 --> 00:03:09,030
Nine questions on the page. Not one a genin could answer.

46
00:03:09,030 --> 00:03:15,008
Naruto reads number five and nearly laughs. It isn't a question. It's a dare.

47
00:03:15,226 --> 00:03:17,715
[SAKURA] Naruto, why aren't you writing anything?

48
00:03:17,855 --> 00:03:20,484
[NARUTO] I'm working. Quietly. Mostly.

49
00:03:20,641 --> 00:03:25,033
So the clerk in him stops reading the paper and starts reading the room.

50
00:03:25,033 --> 00:03:30,095
Every chunin has a clipboard. Every clipboard has a column. Every column is a name.

51
00:03:30,317 --> 00:03:32,571
[NARUTO] They're not grading the paper. They're grading us.

52
00:03:32,710 --> 00:03:35,788
The first Chunin exam tests information gathering.

53
00:03:35,788 --> 00:03:40,589
In canon, you were supposed to cheat. You just weren't supposed to get caught.

54
00:03:41,134 --> 00:03:44,710
Naruto doesn't cheat. He does something sneakier.

55
00:03:44,710 --> 00:03:49,818
A clone, transformed into a pencil, rolls quietly under Kabuto's desk.

56
00:03:50,031 --> 00:03:53,600
[CLONE] Boss. I'm a pencil. I have never been so humiliated.

57
00:03:53,530 --> 00:03:55,867
[CLONE] Kabuto's copying the girl two rows ahead.

58
00:03:55,867 --> 00:03:58,604
[CLONE] He's not even looking down. Nobody's caught him.

59
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,534
[NARUTO] Good. Write all of it down.

60
00:04:00,681 --> 00:04:09,328
Then Ibiki asks the tenth question. Leave now and fail with your team, or stay and risk never being a chunin again.

61
00:04:09,328 --> 00:04:12,185
Half the room walks out. Naruto stays.

62
00:04:12,385 --> 00:04:15,914
[NARUTO] I'm not going anywhere. I've never once left before the last page.

63
00:04:16,044 --> 00:04:20,593
[IBIKI] Everyone who stayed passes. Uzumaki, your paper is blank.

64
00:04:20,713 --> 00:04:23,217
[NARUTO] Yeah. That isn't the exam. This is.

65
00:04:23,362 --> 00:04:28,970
Four pages. Every cheater by row and method, and one name circled three times.

66
00:04:28,970 --> 00:04:30,911
Ibiki reads it standing up.

67
00:04:31,128 --> 00:04:34,712
[IBIKI] Kid, you handed me a report instead of an exam.

68
00:04:34,862 --> 00:04:35,981
[NARUTO] Isn't that the same thing?

69
00:04:36,123 --> 00:04:36,967
[IBIKI] Today it is.

70
00:04:37,104 --> 00:04:40,002
Across the hall, Kabuto's smile doesn't move.

71
00:04:40,002 --> 00:04:44,638
But for the first time, someone in the room is writing down exactly why.

72
00:04:47,269 --> 00:04:50,133
The second exam is the Forest of Death.

73
00:04:50,133 --> 00:04:57,183
Five days, one scroll each, a wall of trees, and Anko Mitarashi, who loves her job far too much.

74
00:04:57,429 --> 00:05:00,889
[ANKO] Welcome to the Forest of Death! Sign the waiver.

75
00:05:00,889 --> 00:05:04,133
[ANKO] If you die, don't blame me. Blame the tigers.

76
00:05:04,276 --> 00:05:06,155
[NARUTO] Is it too late to pick a smaller forest?

77
00:05:06,297 --> 00:05:09,431
[ANKO] Yes! The gate opens in five minutes!

78
00:05:09,542 --> 00:05:12,756
The night before, Naruto knocked on one more door.

79
00:05:12,756 --> 00:05:16,421
Anko Mitarashi opened it with a dango stick in her teeth.

80
00:05:16,663 --> 00:05:18,650
[NARUTO] I read your file. And your old teacher's.

81
00:05:18,650 --> 00:05:22,867
[NARUTO] If anyone from the Grass shows up in that forest, don't be the last person to find out.

82
00:05:22,990 --> 00:05:24,654
[ANKO] Where did you get that name, kid?

83
00:05:24,789 --> 00:05:29,963
[NARUTO] Unclassified shelf, filed under O. It's not a secret. Nobody just wanted to read it.

84
00:05:30,086 --> 00:05:34,182
Anko doesn't say thank you. She does something more useful.

85
00:05:34,182 --> 00:05:39,180
She puts four ANBU on the tower roof and swallows the dango stick whole.

86
00:05:39,381 --> 00:05:47,722
Then the gate opens. The Second Hokage invented the Shadow Clone Jutsu for scouting, and Naruto finally uses it that way.

87
00:05:47,722 --> 00:05:51,375
Two hundred clones, two hundred trees, ten at a time.

88
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:56,608
[CLONE] Boss, tree forty. A snake the size of a bus, eating a boar. Not ours.

89
00:05:56,538 --> 00:05:59,021
[CLONE] Boss, a tiger's sitting on a team from Rain.

90
00:05:59,021 --> 00:06:01,392
[CLONE] The team's fine. The tiger looks confused.

91
00:06:01,534 --> 00:06:03,478
[NARUTO] Mark both. We go west.

92
00:06:03,588 --> 00:06:06,932
[CLONE] Boss, west has a lake. There's a very large frog in it.

93
00:06:07,075 --> 00:06:07,934
[NARUTO] Is it friendly?

94
00:06:08,057 --> 00:06:10,276
[CLONE] It's eating the tiger. I'd say no.

95
00:06:10,417 --> 00:06:12,536
[NARUTO] Okay. South of the frog, then.

96
00:06:12,655 --> 00:06:14,499
[SASUKE] Why are we walking in a circle?

97
00:06:14,617 --> 00:06:16,636
[NARUTO] It's not a circle. It's around the bad bit.

98
00:06:16,769 --> 00:06:17,703
[SAKURA] What bad bit?

99
00:06:17,838 --> 00:06:22,977
[NARUTO] Every bad bit. I've got a map. It's in my head, and my head is in two hundred trees.

100
00:06:23,095 --> 00:06:24,589
[SASUKE] This feels like cheating.

101
00:06:24,737 --> 00:06:27,546
[NARUTO] It's called scouting. A guy invented it. Look him up.

102
00:06:27,658 --> 00:06:32,857
[CLONE] Boss. Grass team, sector eleven. Three genin. Two of them walk like genin.

103
00:06:32,985 --> 00:06:33,839
[NARUTO] And the third one?

104
00:06:33,972 --> 00:06:36,952
[CLONE] His feet don't make a sound. The leaves don't move.

105
00:06:36,952 --> 00:06:39,581
[CLONE] And his eyes are yellow. He blinked sideways.

106
00:06:39,703 --> 00:06:41,510
Below, the Grass team stops.

107
00:06:41,510 --> 00:06:49,127
The third genin tilts his head and looks up into the canopy, at two hundred trees and one clone that looks right back.

108
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:52,194
[OROCHIMARU] Strange. The forest feels like it's counting us.

109
00:06:52,311 --> 00:06:55,421
Naruto remembers page forty of an old file.

110
00:06:55,421 --> 00:07:01,785
A missing nin, a yellow gaze, a student who learned everything and kept the wrong parts.

111
00:07:02,004 --> 00:07:03,653
[NARUTO] Orochimaru.

112
00:07:03,788 --> 00:07:05,498
He pops a messenger clone.

113
00:07:05,498 --> 00:07:10,957
It runs, one branch every half second, straight to the tower where Anko is waiting.

114
00:07:11,197 --> 00:07:16,501
[CLONE] Grass team, sector eleven! Yellow eyes! The boss says do not engage!

115
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:19,179
[ANKO] Understood. Nobody goes near the Grass team.

116
00:07:19,179 --> 00:07:22,134
[ANKO] Tell him thank you. And tell him I said it quietly.

117
00:07:22,252 --> 00:07:26,537
By the time her squad reaches sector eleven, the Grass team is gone.

118
00:07:26,537 --> 00:07:29,751
A headband sits folded on a branch, and that's all.

119
00:07:30,006 --> 00:07:34,753
Team Seven never meets Orochimaru. Nobody bites Sasuke's neck.

120
00:07:34,753 --> 00:07:38,505
In canon, this is the afternoon that changes him.

121
00:07:39,020 --> 00:07:43,457
They reach the tower on day three with both scrolls and not a scratch.

122
00:07:43,457 --> 00:07:49,034
Then two hundred trees of tiredness arrive at once, and Naruto falls asleep standing up.

123
00:07:49,253 --> 00:07:53,002
[SAKURA] Naruto? Naruto! He's asleep. Standing up.

124
00:07:53,125 --> 00:07:54,889
[SASUKE] Leave him. He earned it.

125
00:07:57,438 --> 00:08:03,396
The month before the final. Sasuke Uchiha has a problem, and the problem is orange.

126
00:08:03,396 --> 00:08:05,837
Naruto keeps getting ahead of him.

127
00:08:06,095 --> 00:08:07,824
[SASUKE] How many hours do you train?

128
00:08:07,975 --> 00:08:12,664
[NARUTO] Two thousand a day. Sort of. It's mostly clones. I mostly nap.

129
00:08:12,820 --> 00:08:13,909
[SASUKE] That isn't fair.

130
00:08:14,058 --> 00:08:15,967
[NARUTO] No. It's maths, ya know.

131
00:08:16,090 --> 00:08:21,759
Sasuke's goal is older than the exam, older than Team Seven, older than his headband.

132
00:08:21,759 --> 00:08:25,094
Falling behind the dead last was never part of it.

133
00:08:25,299 --> 00:08:30,498
[SASUKE] I need to be stronger. Nothing else matters. Not you, not the exam.

134
00:08:30,632 --> 00:08:32,441
[NARUTO] Okay. Then use me.

135
00:08:32,573 --> 00:08:33,662
[SASUKE] What did you say?

136
00:08:33,814 --> 00:08:36,426
[NARUTO] Forty sparring partners, whenever you want them.

137
00:08:36,426 --> 00:08:40,725
[NARUTO] And every report ever filed on the Sharingan. Who beat it. Who lost to it. How.

138
00:08:40,867 --> 00:08:44,503
It's the only way Naruto knows to say I'm on your side.

139
00:08:44,503 --> 00:08:48,536
He doesn't say it out loud. He's a filing clerk. He files it.

140
00:08:48,774 --> 00:08:49,968
[SASUKE] Why would you help me?

141
00:08:50,089 --> 00:08:53,333
[NARUTO] Nobody ever trained with me. So I know exactly what it's worth.

142
00:08:53,477 --> 00:08:56,176
[SASUKE] Fine. Forty. Start now.

143
00:08:56,296 --> 00:08:58,416
Forty Narutos, ten at a time.

144
00:08:58,416 --> 00:09:03,900
Sasuke's Sharingan catches every pattern, so Naruto shows it nothing twice.

145
00:09:04,106 --> 00:09:07,080
[CLONE] Ow! He hit me! Boss, he hit me!

146
00:09:07,235 --> 00:09:08,799
[NARUTO] I know. I felt it.

147
00:09:08,950 --> 00:09:10,519
[SASUKE] Why do you keep flinching?

148
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:11,938
[NARUTO] Because I'm the one who gets hit.

149
00:09:12,091 --> 00:09:14,325
[SASUKE] Again. Faster this time.

150
00:09:14,448 --> 00:09:16,447
[CLONE] Boss, I don't want to be next.

151
00:09:16,557 --> 00:09:18,371
[NARUTO] You're a clone. You're always next.

152
00:09:18,511 --> 00:09:21,738
The Sharingan reads motion. The reports read habit.

153
00:09:21,738 --> 00:09:28,445
By week three, Sasuke has lost to the same boy twelve different ways and learned something from every one.

154
00:09:28,649 --> 00:09:33,178
Kakashi shows up three hours late to a session he didn't schedule.

155
00:09:33,178 --> 00:09:35,648
He's always late. Every single time.

156
00:09:36,155 --> 00:09:38,609
[KAKASHI] I see someone's been reading about me.

157
00:09:38,751 --> 00:09:39,955
[SASUKE] About the Sharingan.

158
00:09:40,087 --> 00:09:41,291
[KAKASHI] Same thing.

159
00:09:41,437 --> 00:09:42,811
[SAKURA] Can I train with you two as well?

160
00:09:42,923 --> 00:09:46,797
[NARUTO] Sure! I've got a file on chakra control. It's mostly about you.

161
00:09:46,943 --> 00:09:48,487
[SAKURA] Why is there a file about me?

162
00:09:48,631 --> 00:09:50,710
[NARUTO] You're really good at it. I read it for fun.

163
00:09:50,864 --> 00:09:55,659
Sasuke doesn't say thank you. At sundown he says, same time tomorrow.

164
00:09:55,659 --> 00:09:57,883
From an Uchiha, that's a speech.

165
00:10:00,483 --> 00:10:06,284
A week before the final, a clone files a hospital incident report. Patient, Rock Lee.

166
00:10:06,284 --> 00:10:11,402
Cause of injury, sand. Eleven witnesses. None of them can say how it moved.

167
00:10:11,645 --> 00:10:14,606
[CLONE] Boss. The sand moved before he was hit. It guarded him.

168
00:10:14,606 --> 00:10:17,889
[CLONE] And the Sand genin's chart says nobody's ever seen him sleep.

169
00:10:18,027 --> 00:10:19,796
[NARUTO] Never sleeps. Huh.

170
00:10:19,917 --> 00:10:22,643
He knows one other person who sleeps badly.

171
00:10:22,643 --> 00:10:30,061
That night Naruto closes his eyes and walks down into the dark, past the bars, to ask the only expert in the village.

172
00:10:30,277 --> 00:10:32,051
[NARUTO] Hey, fox. You awake?

173
00:10:32,161 --> 00:10:36,425
[KURAMA] Always, brat. Your snoring echoes.

174
00:10:36,569 --> 00:10:37,643
[NARUTO] I don't snore.

175
00:10:37,801 --> 00:10:42,140
[KURAMA] You do. I have twelve years of data, brat.

176
00:10:42,289 --> 00:10:46,178
[NARUTO] That Sand kid. The sand that moves on its own. Is that like you?

177
00:10:46,299 --> 00:10:52,858
[KURAMA] Shukaku. A raccoon dog with a sand fixation and no manners.

178
00:10:52,979 --> 00:10:58,233
[KURAMA] That raccoon never sleeps because his cage is badly made.

179
00:10:58,390 --> 00:10:59,824
[NARUTO] What's a badly made cage?

180
00:10:59,935 --> 00:11:04,061
[KURAMA] A cheap lock. A maker in a hurry, or afraid.

181
00:11:04,061 --> 00:11:11,094
[KURAMA] The bars don't hold, so the prisoner never rests, and neither does the boy.

182
00:11:11,205 --> 00:11:13,564
Kurama is quiet for a long moment.

183
00:11:13,564 --> 00:11:17,589
It's the same quiet as a clone reading to him in the dark.

184
00:11:17,843 --> 00:11:25,387
[KURAMA] Mine was made well. By a man who loved the boy it was for. I hate that I know that.

185
00:11:25,511 --> 00:11:29,971
The next night Naruto finds Gaara on a rooftop at the edge of the village.

186
00:11:29,971 --> 00:11:34,250
Sand curls around his feet like a pet that has learned not to be loved.

187
00:11:34,492 --> 00:11:38,471
[GAARA] Leave. Everyone who comes this close dies. It's the only reason anyone comes.

188
00:11:38,628 --> 00:11:43,052
[NARUTO] I'm not here to fight. I read the report on Lee. The sand moves before you do.

189
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,124
[GAARA] It protects me.

190
00:11:44,243 --> 00:11:44,932
[NARUTO] From who?

191
00:11:45,079 --> 00:11:45,903
[GAARA] Everyone.

192
00:11:46,062 --> 00:11:50,031
[NARUTO] You don't sleep, do you? Because if you sleep, he takes the wheel.

193
00:11:50,165 --> 00:11:56,354
The sand stops moving. For the first time since Naruto arrived, Gaara looks at him.

194
00:11:56,921 --> 00:11:57,845
[GAARA] Who told you that?

195
00:11:57,963 --> 00:12:01,742
[NARUTO] Nobody. Mine talks too. Mine just reads over my shoulder.

196
00:12:01,853 --> 00:12:04,317
[GAARA] Then you're lying, or you're the same as me.

197
00:12:04,469 --> 00:12:06,786
[NARUTO] I got lucky. People walked toward me.

198
00:12:06,786 --> 00:12:10,168
[NARUTO] Late, but they walked. You got a cage with a bad lock.

199
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:14,239
[NARUTO] That doesn't make you the monster. It means whoever built it was in a hurry.

200
00:12:14,398 --> 00:12:15,382
[GAARA] Stop talking.

201
00:12:15,507 --> 00:12:18,248
[NARUTO] Okay. I can't fix it. I'm not gonna pretend I can.

202
00:12:18,248 --> 00:12:20,496
[NARUTO] I just wanted someone to say it out loud.

203
00:12:20,652 --> 00:12:23,410
It cures nothing. Gaara doesn't thank him.

204
00:12:23,410 --> 00:12:30,501
But the sand that has moved for him every night for years hesitates for one second, and then it stays still.

205
00:12:30,709 --> 00:12:33,672
Naruto walks home with no plan for this one.

206
00:12:33,672 --> 00:12:37,173
For the first time in a month, he has nothing filed.

207
00:12:39,776 --> 00:12:45,546
The month ends at the mail desk. One envelope from the Hidden Sand, sealed in wax.

208
00:12:45,546 --> 00:12:49,205
It confirms the Kazekage's seat at the Chunin final.

209
00:12:49,458 --> 00:12:53,457
[CLONE] Boss, standard form. He's coming. He wants the good chair.

210
00:12:53,583 --> 00:12:54,792
[NARUTO] Read me the signature.

211
00:12:54,951 --> 00:12:59,640
[CLONE] Soft. Round. Every downstroke curves. Looks like a swan wrote it.

212
00:12:59,792 --> 00:13:00,741
Naruto stops.

213
00:13:00,741 --> 00:13:07,381
He walks to a drawer, pulls out an old letter filed under S, and lays the two side by side.

214
00:13:07,590 --> 00:13:10,904
[CLONE] Boss, you said the old one signs like he's stabbing the page.

215
00:13:11,017 --> 00:13:15,311
[NARUTO] He did. He pressed so hard the brush split. This man doesn't press at all.

216
00:13:15,444 --> 00:13:21,774
Same name, same seat, same wax. One signature stabs the page. The other flows like water.

217
00:13:21,774 --> 00:13:26,468
A man can change his face. He doesn't change his hand by accident.

218
00:13:26,686 --> 00:13:30,475
[NARUTO] He's dead. The Kazekage's dead, and somebody's signing in his place.

219
00:13:30,599 --> 00:13:32,324
In canon, he's right.

220
00:13:32,324 --> 00:13:39,058
Orochimaru killed the Fourth Kazekage and took his chair, and the Sand never knew.

221
00:13:39,532 --> 00:13:41,546
[CLONE] Boss. That's a head of state.

222
00:13:41,686 --> 00:13:43,595
[NARUTO] I know. That's the problem.

223
00:13:43,713 --> 00:13:44,737
[CLONE] Should we tell somebody?

224
00:13:44,870 --> 00:13:47,619
[NARUTO] We're going to tell everybody. Nobody's going to listen.

225
00:13:47,776 --> 00:13:49,724
He takes it to Kakashi first.

226
00:13:49,724 --> 00:13:55,365
Kakashi reads both letters for a long minute, which for Kakashi is a very long time.

227
00:13:55,598 --> 00:14:01,172
[KAKASHI] Naruto. I like you. But a signature isn't a body.

228
00:14:01,286 --> 00:14:04,345
[NARUTO] It's the last habit a body keeps. And this one's a swan.

229
00:14:04,457 --> 00:14:07,631
[KAKASHI] It's a lovely theory. Nobody will believe it.

230
00:14:07,759 --> 00:14:10,913
[NARUTO] If I'm right, you'll have to explain it to the council.

231
00:14:11,072 --> 00:14:14,352
[KAKASHI] And if you're wrong, I'll have to explain you.

232
00:14:14,500 --> 00:14:19,956
He's right. The council hears about it in eleven minutes and laughs for twelve.

233
00:14:19,956 --> 00:14:21,544
Only one elder doesn't.

234
00:14:21,760 --> 00:14:25,599
[DANZO] A boy who reads handwriting. Keep him close, Hiruzen.

235
00:14:25,738 --> 00:14:27,372
[HIRUZEN] I intend to.

236
00:14:27,524 --> 00:14:30,712
Nobody believes a filing clerk about a head of state.

237
00:14:30,712 --> 00:14:33,118
Nobody except the old man who hired him.

238
00:14:33,357 --> 00:14:34,231
[HIRUZEN] Show me.

239
00:14:34,388 --> 00:14:38,102
The Third Hokage studies the two signatures for a long time.

240
00:14:38,102 --> 00:14:39,587
Then he lowers his pipe.

241
00:14:39,829 --> 00:14:45,122
[HIRUZEN] I taught that hand its letters. The neatest brush in my class.

242
00:14:45,122 --> 00:14:48,708
[HIRUZEN] Never pressed hard on anything, even then.

243
00:14:48,835 --> 00:14:49,829
[NARUTO] You know who it is.

244
00:14:49,987 --> 00:14:54,966
[HIRUZEN] I know who I'm afraid it is. That isn't the same thing.

245
00:14:55,104 --> 00:14:56,179
[NARUTO] He'll sit beside you.

246
00:14:56,179 --> 00:14:59,508
[NARUTO] In front of ten thousand people, in the best seat in the stadium.

247
00:14:59,621 --> 00:15:07,085
[HIRUZEN] Protocol. The Hokage sits beside the Kazekage. If I don't, he knows.

248
00:15:07,227 --> 00:15:09,846
[NARUTO] Old man. Why are you the one sitting in that chair?

249
00:15:09,977 --> 00:15:13,483
The old man's left hand forms a cross seal on the desk.

250
00:15:13,483 --> 00:15:17,436
He still hasn't noticed. Naruto has been noticing for a month.

251
00:15:17,660 --> 00:15:19,744
[HIRUZEN] Who said it would be me?

252
00:15:22,274 --> 00:15:23,476
The Chunin final.

253
00:15:23,476 --> 00:15:31,328
Ten thousand seats, every one full, and a village that believes the worst thing today can bring is a bad match.

254
00:15:31,561 --> 00:15:34,259
Sasuke isn't here. Neither is Kakashi.

255
00:15:34,259 --> 00:15:39,585
In canon, both arrive late to the final, and the match is nearly forfeited.

256
00:15:40,116 --> 00:15:44,805
[CLONE] Boss. I'm a filing box in the exam office. A proctor just put his coffee on me.

257
00:15:44,735 --> 00:15:46,869
[CLONE] The Sand kid asked about Sasuke's match.

258
00:15:46,869 --> 00:15:50,444
[CLONE] The proctor showed him the postponement form. Filed three days ago.

259
00:15:50,567 --> 00:15:51,671
[NARUTO] Whose handwriting?

260
00:15:51,809 --> 00:15:53,473
[CLONE] Yours, Boss. Obviously.

261
00:15:53,596 --> 00:15:57,558
Nobody can disqualify a boy who has been officially delayed.

262
00:15:57,558 --> 00:16:03,105
Naruto filed the form before anyone knew they'd need it. That's what a clerk is for.

263
00:16:03,309 --> 00:16:06,683
[KAKASHI] Sorry we're late. A black cat crossed my path.

264
00:16:06,843 --> 00:16:09,882
[SASUKE] He made us take the long way around the whole village.

265
00:16:10,010 --> 00:16:11,804
[NARUTO] Right on time. Technically.

266
00:16:11,942 --> 00:16:17,875
Above them, in the Kage's box, the Hokage and the Kazekage sit side by side.

267
00:16:17,875 --> 00:16:22,481
The Hokage smokes his pipe. The Kazekage smiles at nothing.

268
00:16:22,692 --> 00:16:27,989
Then the feathers fall. White, soft, drifting over the stands like snow.

269
00:16:27,989 --> 00:16:31,446
In ten seconds, ten thousand people are asleep.

270
00:16:31,686 --> 00:16:34,347
Kabuto is the only one still standing.

271
00:16:34,347 --> 00:16:39,740
The ANBU assigned to watch him are asleep in the third row, and so is Naruto.

272
00:16:39,968 --> 00:16:46,732
The plan has a hole, and it's exactly the shape of an ANBU squad. Ten squads were meant to hold the gates.

273
00:16:46,732 --> 00:16:51,327
All ten are dreaming, and Sound ninja are already coming over the walls.

274
00:16:51,562 --> 00:17:00,135
On the roof, four violet flames go up, four Sound ninja take their corners, and a dome closes over the Kage's box.

275
00:17:00,135 --> 00:17:02,316
The Kazekage removes his hat.

276
00:17:02,517 --> 00:17:06,101
[OROCHIMARU] Hello, Sensei. It's been so long. You've grown old.

277
00:17:06,214 --> 00:17:11,113
[HIRUZEN] So have you, Orochimaru. You used to knock.

278
00:17:11,255 --> 00:17:15,654
[OROCHIMARU] This barrier holds until one of us stops breathing. I'd hoped it would be you.

279
00:17:15,775 --> 00:17:17,279
[HIRUZEN] I'm sure you did.

280
00:17:17,433 --> 00:17:23,169
The Third Hokage can use shadow clones, and he's been using one all afternoon.

281
00:17:23,169 --> 00:17:23,757
It pops.

282
00:17:24,334 --> 00:17:29,882
On the next rooftop, the real Hokage feels the whole conversation arrive at once.

283
00:17:29,882 --> 00:17:35,703
Jiraiya stands on his left. Four ANBU wait behind him. They've been there since dawn.

284
00:17:35,927 --> 00:17:39,770
And Orochimaru is standing alone inside his own barrier.

285
00:17:39,770 --> 00:17:44,506
It holds until someone stops breathing. There's nobody in it but him.

286
00:17:45,102 --> 00:17:48,711
[JIRAIYA] Orochimaru. You always did build a lovely cage.

287
00:17:48,841 --> 00:17:53,775
[HIRUZEN] Your barrier is excellent. But a boy read your handwriting.

288
00:17:53,924 --> 00:17:57,723
[OROCHIMARU] A boy? Sensei, since when do you take advice from clerks?

289
00:17:57,840 --> 00:18:00,559
[HIRUZEN] Since one of them started being right.

290
00:18:00,710 --> 00:18:02,086
It should end there.

291
00:18:02,086 --> 00:18:08,964
But Naruto's plan needed somebody awake in the stands, and every awake person in it is a filing box.

292
00:18:09,205 --> 00:18:11,729
[CLONE] Boss! Boss, wake up! Boss!

293
00:18:11,861 --> 00:18:16,257
The box can't shout through a genjutsu. But it remembers rule three.

294
00:18:16,257 --> 00:18:23,240
A clone that gets hit pops, and he keeps the hit. The only way to hit a sleeping boy is to hit someone else.

295
00:18:23,475 --> 00:18:26,670
The box drops its disguise, walks out into the open,

296
00:18:26,670 --> 00:18:29,804
and lets a Sound ninja put a kunai in its shoulder.

297
00:18:30,061 --> 00:18:32,525
[CLONE] Ow. Okay. That one's mine.

298
00:18:32,642 --> 00:18:33,555
The clone pops.

299
00:18:33,555 --> 00:18:39,826
In the stands, Naruto jolts awake with a stab in his shoulder and a minute of someone else's afternoon.

300
00:18:40,074 --> 00:18:44,038
[NARUTO] That hurts. Okay. Okay. Everybody's asleep.

301
00:18:44,198 --> 00:18:49,152
[NARUTO] Forty clones is four batches. That's a four hour headache later. Fine. Fine.

302
00:18:49,265 --> 00:18:52,769
[KABUTO] Impressive. Nobody wakes up from that. Not even jonin.

303
00:18:52,924 --> 00:18:55,448
[NARUTO] One of me got stabbed. It's a long story.

304
00:18:55,573 --> 00:18:58,237
[KABUTO] You're a very strange boy, Naruto.

305
00:18:58,362 --> 00:19:02,076
He can't wake ten thousand people. But he can wake forty.

306
00:19:02,076 --> 00:19:08,786
Every genjutsu report he ever filed says the same thing. Pain breaks it. So forty Narutos run the rows.

307
00:19:09,034 --> 00:19:11,933
[CLONE] Sorry! Emergency! Sorry! Sorry!

308
00:19:12,090 --> 00:19:14,424
[IRUKA] Naruto? Did you just slap me?

309
00:19:14,548 --> 00:19:17,082
[NARUTO] Sorry, sensei! It was an emergency!

310
00:19:17,208 --> 00:19:19,492
[IRUKA] Then go! I'll take the left side!

311
00:19:19,637 --> 00:19:21,226
[SAKURA] Naruto, you slapped me!

312
00:19:21,336 --> 00:19:23,540
[NARUTO] You were asleep! It counts as medicine!

313
00:19:23,699 --> 00:19:28,643
Kabuto doesn't fight a boy with forty witnesses. He's gone before the third slap.

314
00:19:28,849 --> 00:19:31,713
Ten squads wake up angry and head for the gates,

315
00:19:31,713 --> 00:19:34,278
and two late arrivals head for them faster.

316
00:19:34,496 --> 00:19:38,600
[KAKASHI] Sasuke, east gate. I'll take the west one.

317
00:19:38,739 --> 00:19:39,933
[SASUKE] Try not to be late.

318
00:19:40,077 --> 00:19:42,651
[KAKASHI] I'm already here. Give me some credit.

319
00:19:42,797 --> 00:19:48,636
And in the middle of the arena, Gaara stands alone. The sand is up. It isn't moving.

320
00:19:48,859 --> 00:19:52,308
[GAARA] The man in the white hat gave the order. He said he was my father.

321
00:19:52,441 --> 00:19:55,140
[NARUTO] He wasn't. I've got the handwriting. I'm sorry.

322
00:19:55,257 --> 00:19:57,506
[GAARA] Then who has been giving the orders?

323
00:19:57,617 --> 00:20:04,408
Naruto doesn't have an answer the boy would believe. The sand rises, then lowers. It cures nothing.

324
00:20:04,408 --> 00:20:11,131
But it doesn't go for Naruto, and it doesn't go for the village. After a while, Gaara just leaves.

325
00:20:11,360 --> 00:20:16,623
On the roof, the Sound Four have to drop their own barrier to let their master out.

326
00:20:16,623 --> 00:20:24,169
The moment it falls, Orochimaru is fighting his old teacher and his old teammate at once. He loses ground every minute.

327
00:20:24,382 --> 00:20:28,696
[OROCHIMARU] Who wrote this plan, Sensei? It isn't yours. It's far too tidy.

328
00:20:28,840 --> 00:20:29,729
[HIRUZEN] A clerk.

329
00:20:29,870 --> 00:20:36,244
Orochimaru does what he has always done when a plan goes wrong. He leaves. He keeps his arms.

330
00:20:36,244 --> 00:20:42,139
Hiruzen lets him go, because the village needs its Hokage more than it needs a grudge.

331
00:20:42,341 --> 00:20:52,154
The Sand shinobi hold their line for an hour. Then word spreads that the Kazekage's chair held a stranger, and they have no reason left to be here.

332
00:20:52,154 --> 00:20:55,825
By dusk, the invasion is over. It lasted one afternoon.

333
00:20:58,443 --> 00:21:01,365
In canon, the Third Hokage dies on that roof.

334
00:21:01,365 --> 00:21:08,442
Tonight he's in a hospital bed with a stitched shoulder, a burned sleeve, and strong opinions about the soup.

335
00:21:08,673 --> 00:21:10,562
[NARUTO] Old man. You're alive.

336
00:21:10,703 --> 00:21:15,442
[HIRUZEN] So I'm told. I'd like it noted that I planned this.

337
00:21:15,557 --> 00:21:17,386
[NARUTO] You did not. I planned this.

338
00:21:17,503 --> 00:21:20,612
[HIRUZEN] Then I'd like it noted that I approved it.

339
00:21:20,759 --> 00:21:27,173
[HIRUZEN] Naruto. Tell the village I'm fine. Tell them the soup is a crime.

340
00:21:27,286 --> 00:21:31,766
Naruto's reward is paperwork. The aftermath of the invasion.

341
00:21:31,766 --> 00:21:35,275
Eleven thousand pages, one night, forty clones.

342
00:21:35,476 --> 00:21:40,070
He doesn't mind. Paper is the only thing in this village that has never lied to him.

343
00:21:40,286 --> 00:21:45,164
At two in the morning, it does. A gap on the shelf marked Uchiha.

344
00:21:45,164 --> 00:21:47,865
Not a missing file. A missing order.

345
00:21:48,098 --> 00:21:50,207
[CLONE] Boss. The night the Uchiha clan died.

346
00:21:50,207 --> 00:21:52,942
[CLONE] There's no mission order for it. Nothing at all.

347
00:21:53,056 --> 00:21:55,835
[NARUTO] Somebody gave an order. Somebody always gives an order.

348
00:21:55,957 --> 00:21:57,512
[CLONE] There's a leave slip, though.

349
00:21:57,512 --> 00:22:01,266
[CLONE] One ANBU captain, signed out for the night. Look who countersigned it.

350
00:22:01,406 --> 00:22:04,676
A leave slip for the night the Uchiha clan died.

351
00:22:04,676 --> 00:22:10,535
And at the bottom, in a hand he has seen across a council table, one countersignature.

352
00:22:11,063 --> 00:22:12,892
[CLONE] Boss. It says Danzo.

353
00:22:13,048 --> 00:22:14,207
[NARUTO] Don't say it twice.

354
00:22:14,324 --> 00:22:18,816
He looks up. Naruto knows everyone in this village by their footsteps.

355
00:22:18,816 --> 00:22:20,163
He didn't hear these.

356
00:22:20,376 --> 00:22:21,850
[NARUTO] How long have you been standing there?

357
00:22:21,984 --> 00:22:22,838
[SASUKE] Long enough.

